<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-WET FIELD DELAYS TVL VS N.TVL MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WET FIELD DELAYS TVL VS N.TVL MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>CENTURION 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steady rain over the past few days has delayed the start of the four-day Supersport Series cricket match between Northern Transvaal and Transvaal until after lunch on the scheduled opening day at Centurion Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Although no rain fell during the morning, a waterlogged ground prevented play from starting before lunch.</p>
